{
 "_id": "zcUm7ZxWM0gC0yVs",
 "name": "Clan Sorcerer",
 "type": "background",
 "img": "modules/jjk5e/icons/background.svg",
 "folder": "CRaGqJh5HQKmdfVy",
 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p>You have spent your life as a sorcerer being part of a clan. You are well-versed in manipulating Cursed Energy, and you also possess great mastery over your innate technique. You are not necessarily well-treated or even particularly well-liked within your clan.<br />\n<strong>Feat:</strong> Pick one Innate Technique feat<br />\n<strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Insight, History<br />\n<strong>Equipment:</strong> A clan symbol (a gift to you as part of your clan), a technique manual, formal clothing, a set of common clothes, and a wallet containing $1,500.<br />\n<strong>Feature:</strong> <strong>Family Ties</strong><br />\n As a Clan Sorcerer, you command the respect of those in Sorcery, and you are an effective sorcerer. You and your companions can expect to receive help from people who like your family.</p>"
  },
